├─52 paragraph[7]
│    ├─0 text "When a construct's target cannot be resolved statically (Python "
│    ├─1 inlineCode "from m import *"
│    ├─2 text ", JavaScript "
│    ├─3 inlineCode "require(variable)"
│    ├─4 text ", a dynamic "
│    ├─5 inlineCode "import()"
│    └─6 text ", a subscripted decorator), the reader writes the row with an explicit unknown value that carries a reason from the language's closed list. It never omits the row and never marks the whole file partial."
